1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:07,999
=No Way! My Bro is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,160
=Episode 19=

19
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:18,780
This is...

20
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:21,200
The Western Yi totem?

21
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:24,780
Hu Wenyuan and I

22
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:26,220
are both from the Western Yi.

23
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:27,819
I don't know

24
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:29,299
where the money ended up,

25
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:30,099
but

26
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:31,700
I'm sure the Western Yi are involved.

27
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:39,379
Looks like the Western Yi

28
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:40,559
seeks this marriage alliance

29
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,170
for another purpose.

30
00:01:47,380 --> 00:01:49,060
Do you think I did all this

31
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:51,450
just to make money?

32
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:52,790
Xiao Ce,

33
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:55,060
you're still too naive.

34
00:01:55,580 --> 00:01:56,939
Did it never occur to you

35
00:01:56,940 --> 00:01:58,329
what we needed

36
00:01:58,330 --> 00:01:59,860
all that money for?

37
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:02,730
Could it be

38
00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:05,710
there's someone

39
00:02:05,950 --> 00:02:07,730
behind Hu Wenyuan?

40
00:02:09,010 --> 00:02:10,489
A nation's stability

41
00:02:10,490 --> 00:02:11,999
rests upon the rule of law.

42
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,449
The realm prospers

43
00:02:13,450 --> 00:02:15,110
through loyal ministers.

44
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:16,459
Gu Bei

45
00:02:16,460 --> 00:02:17,859
tracked down the traffickers

46
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:19,420
with courage and resolve,

47
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,379
putting an end to the chaos

48
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:23,419
and bringing peace to the people.

49
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,929
It greatly pleases me.

50
00:02:24,930 --> 00:02:26,859
Therefore, I hereby promote him in rank

51
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:28,740
to honor his service.

52
00:02:30,610 --> 00:02:32,690
Thank you, Your Majesty.

53
00:02:33,140 --> 00:02:34,180
I invited

54
00:02:34,420 --> 00:02:36,250
the Princess Royal today

55
00:02:36,610 --> 00:02:37,740
so

56
00:02:37,930 --> 00:02:39,620
we could all celebrate

57
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:41,929
the eradication of Fushou Cream

58
00:02:41,930 --> 00:02:43,300
from Jing.

59
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:44,370
Of course,

60
00:02:45,050 --> 00:02:46,500
I'd also like to ask Aunt

61
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:49,220
to offer prayers
for those who lost their lives

62
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:50,410
because of Fushou Cream.

63
00:02:51,330 --> 00:02:52,900
Your Majesty is most compassionate.

64
00:02:53,050 --> 00:02:54,780
I will do my utmost

65
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:56,460
to pray for all living beings.

66
00:02:57,980 --> 00:02:58,850
Your Majesty,

67
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,640
the Western Yi delegation
will arrive in the capital soon.

68
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:03,960
Though Your Majesty
has no intention of a marriage alliance,

69
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,920
Jing is the leading empire,

70
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:09,850
we should still receive them
with due courtesy to display our grace.

71
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:11,690
Official Li makes a good point.

72
00:03:12,770 --> 00:03:13,769
Then let

73
00:03:13,770 --> 00:03:17,259
- Official Gu Bei handle the reception.
- I...

74
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:17,930
Though Official Gu

75
00:03:18,530 --> 00:03:20,370
is loyal and brave,

76
00:03:20,650 --> 00:03:21,489
he's never

77
00:03:21,490 --> 00:03:23,370
dealt with the Western Yi before.

78
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,139
In the late Emperor's reign,

79
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:27,740
I accompanied him
on a diplomatic mission to the Western Yi

80
00:03:28,050 --> 00:03:29,930
and learned something of their customs.

81
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:31,209
Why don't

82
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:32,459
I accompany Official Gu

83
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:33,780
to receive them?

84
00:03:34,650 --> 00:03:35,530
Very well.

85
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:36,970
Thank you, Aunt.

86
00:03:38,210 --> 00:03:39,809
(Why is the Princess Royal)

87
00:03:39,810 --> 00:03:41,139
(suddenly become so concerned)

88
00:03:41,140 --> 00:03:42,530
(with court affairs?)

89
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,969
(Changle Gate)

90
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:48,700
Quite the grand airs.

91
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:51,020
We've been waiting over two hours.

92
00:03:51,330 --> 00:03:52,250
Official Gu,

93
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:53,750
please be patient.

94
00:03:53,930 --> 00:03:55,209
The Western Yi people

95
00:03:55,210 --> 00:03:56,690
have never been punctual.

96
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:59,480
Your Highness, why not head into the city
and get some rest?

97
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:00,900
Once they arrive,

98
00:04:01,260 --> 00:04:02,699
I'll come

99
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:03,970
fetch you.

100
00:04:04,020 --> 00:04:06,090
We agreed to welcome them together.

101
00:04:06,490 --> 00:04:08,090
How could I leave you

102
00:04:08,140 --> 00:04:09,300
here alone?

103
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:26,380
I'm Gu Bei,
Commander of the Imperial Guards,

104
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,290
sent by His Majesty to receive

105
00:04:28,530 --> 00:04:30,200
the Western Yi delegation.

106
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,089
(Jiaye, Western Yi Envoy)
You've had a long journey.

107
00:04:32,090 --> 00:04:33,780
Please proceed to the relay station.

108
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:35,780
I hear

109
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:37,579
Jing is rich in treasures.

110
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,899
Does the relay station

111
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:40,780
have fine wine and beautiful women?

112
00:04:45,820 --> 00:04:47,020
Dismount.

113
00:04:47,210 --> 00:04:48,260
Your Excellency,

114
00:04:48,330 --> 00:04:49,940
it's the law in Jing.

115
00:04:52,730 --> 00:04:53,650
Ridiculous.

116
00:04:54,330 --> 00:04:55,410
In Western Yi,

117
00:04:55,650 --> 00:04:56,379
we ride our horses

118
00:04:56,380 --> 00:04:58,340
right into the royal palace.

119
00:04:58,580 --> 00:04:59,819
Why can't we

120
00:04:59,820 --> 00:05:01,240
ride through your city gate?

121
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:06,380
I'll say it again.

122
00:05:07,210 --> 00:05:09,290
Dismount and enter on foot.

123
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:12,289
The Western Yi certainly are arrogant.

124
00:05:12,290 --> 00:05:13,850
When the late Emperor reigned,

125
00:05:13,900 --> 00:05:16,900
he seized eighteen prefectures
from Western Yi in battle.

126
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:19,580
Your king came
bearing a sheep to surrender.

127
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:22,139
Have you forgotten?

128
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:24,730
How dare you insult our king!

129
00:05:25,330 --> 00:05:27,139
His Majesty has shown restraint

130
00:05:27,140 --> 00:05:29,290
and spared you war.

131
00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:31,650
Yet you dare behave so insolently?

132
00:05:32,170 --> 00:05:33,020
Gu Bei.

133
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:34,260
Yes, Your Highness.

134
00:05:34,700 --> 00:05:36,490
Listen carefully.

135
00:05:36,850 --> 00:05:38,729
If they dismount
and enter the city peacefully,

136
00:05:38,730 --> 00:05:41,340
they will be pardoned.

137
00:05:42,090 --> 00:05:43,850
But if they insist

138
00:05:44,090 --> 00:05:46,340
on defying Jing's authority,

139
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:47,780
kill them.

140
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:48,780
As you command,

141
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:50,780
Your servant obeys.

142
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:56,780
Gu Bei, after you've escorted them
to the relay station,

143
00:05:56,970 --> 00:05:58,850
come to my residence.

144
00:05:59,970 --> 00:06:01,380
I have something to ask you.

145
00:06:04,730 --> 00:06:05,380
Your Highness.

146
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:06,780
Your Highness.

147
00:06:20,530 --> 00:06:22,140
Not a bad place.

148
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:25,440
(Huaitan Records)

149
00:06:33,580 --> 00:06:34,530
Erotic paintings?

150
00:06:35,530 --> 00:06:37,140
Wasn't she supposed to be devoted

151
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:38,850
to Buddhist practice?

152
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:51,140
Your Highness,

153
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,560
I've escorted the Western Yi envoys
to the relay station.

154
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,209
May I ask

155
00:06:54,210 --> 00:06:55,650
why you summoned me?

156
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:56,970
Actually,

157
00:06:57,260 --> 00:06:58,580
it's nothing.

158
00:06:58,620 --> 00:07:00,020
I simply

159
00:07:00,140 --> 00:07:01,380
want to make you

160
00:07:01,820 --> 00:07:03,220
my male consort.

161
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:05,730
What's with that look?

162
00:07:05,820 --> 00:07:06,900
Compose yourself.

163
00:07:07,380 --> 00:07:08,290
The truth is,

164
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:10,020
I'm already in love.

165
00:07:10,210 --> 00:07:11,170
With three women.

166
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:13,020
One of them is Xiao Ling.

167
00:07:13,770 --> 00:07:14,529
How could I

168
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:15,729
marry her aunt?

169
00:07:15,730 --> 00:07:17,289
I'm taking you in,

170
00:07:17,290 --> 00:07:18,850
not the other way around.

171
00:07:29,020 --> 00:07:30,730
As for your looks,

172
00:07:31,090 --> 00:07:33,040
they're nothing special.

173
00:07:33,060 --> 00:07:35,670
Among all my male consorts,

174
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:37,780
you wouldn't even make the top ten.

175
00:07:39,770 --> 00:07:40,939
Weren't you living in a temple,

176
00:07:40,940 --> 00:07:42,380
devoting yourself to Buddhism?

177
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:45,380
So why

178
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,080
have you given that up?

179
00:07:49,330 --> 00:07:51,139
Because

180
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:52,900
I find you interesting.

181
00:07:53,410 --> 00:07:55,139
What future

182
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:56,970
does an Imperial Guard commander have?

183
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:58,970
Stay with me,

184
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:01,290
and you'll enjoy a life of luxury.

185
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,940
You're His Majesty's aunt,

186
00:08:06,530 --> 00:08:08,290
and he's my friend.

187
00:08:08,850 --> 00:08:09,610
Wouldn't that

188
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:11,460
be inappropriate?

189
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:15,529
Men can have many wives and concubines,

190
00:08:15,530 --> 00:08:17,259
and marry young women.

191
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:19,050
Why can't I take a younger man?

192
00:08:19,700 --> 00:08:20,380
You certainly can.

193
00:08:21,770 --> 00:08:22,730
It's just

194
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:23,970
I still have

195
00:08:24,410 --> 00:08:25,820
something to do today.

196
00:08:27,090 --> 00:08:27,960
Perhaps another time.

197
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,580
I didn't bring you here

198
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:38,770
to let you walk away.

199
00:08:39,410 --> 00:08:40,700
Today,

200
00:08:41,140 --> 00:08:42,130
you'll serve me.

201
00:08:42,810 --> 00:08:43,640
Move.

202
00:08:48,370 --> 00:08:49,310
What are you doing?

203
00:09:01,690 --> 00:09:03,090
Please me,

204
00:09:03,140 --> 00:09:04,180
and I

205
00:09:04,450 --> 00:09:06,060
will reward you well.

206
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,539
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

207
00:09:18,540 --> 00:09:20,939
♪Our spirit soars to the skies♪

208
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:26,379
♪The brainy emperor plots the strategy♪

209
00:09:26,380 --> 00:09:30,739
♪The slacker general leads the charge♪

210
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:33,139
♪Swords clash and warhorses thunder♪

211
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:35,699
♪Let the history judge our deeds♪

212
00:09:35,700 --> 00:09:41,379
♪Our brotherhood is priceless♪

213
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:46,940
♪Peace across the land, carefree at last♪

214
00:09:51,220 --> 00:09:53,260
♪Funny moments never stop♪

215
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:56,100
♪Silly blunders never cease♪

216
00:09:56,300 --> 00:10:00,459
♪Yet through every up and down♪

217
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:02,420
♪We create miracles♪

218
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:05,180
♪From naive youths♪

219
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:07,939
♪To legendary heroes♪

220
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:09,859
♪This journey♪

221
00:10:09,860 --> 00:10:13,899
♪Is one we'll be proud of♪

222
00:10:13,900 --> 00:10:16,420
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

223
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:21,780
♪Let's create♪

224
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:31,740
♪A legend of our own♪
